# Current application; preserve old-layout deletions and exclude local/private artifacts.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/var/
**/output/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/*.pyc
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.zip

# Credentials, local databases, recordings and build/test artifacts.
**/secrets/
**/wallet/
**/wallets/
**/.npmrc
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.sso
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.bak
**/*.wav
**/*.webm
**/*.mp3
**/*.m4a
**/*.flac
**/coverage.xml
**/.coverage*
**/htmlcov/
**/docs/test-results/*
!**/docs/test-results/
!**/docs/test-results/.gitkeep

# Generated audit evidence and historical design assets stay local.
**/docs/reviews/**/evidence/
**/docs/reviews/**/verification.json
**/docs/archive/
**/docs/architecture/
